{"seq":3,"slug":"serverless-scaling","title":"Serverless 弹性：Lambda 并发、Knative 与并发限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms/serverless-scaling","wordCount":1239,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"serverless-弹性-lambda-并发-knative-与并发限制\">Serverless 弹性：Lambda 并发、Knative 与并发限制</h1><p>Serverless 平台将弹性伸缩能力推向极致：函数/服务按请求自动伸缩，无需预配置容量，最低可缩到零，最高可在秒级扩展到数千并发实例。但这种弹性并非免费——并发限制、冷启动延迟和成本模型需要深入理解才能正确使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并发（Concurrency）</td>\n<td>同时处理的请求数；Lambda 中每个执行中的调用占用一个并发单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保留并发</td>\n<td>为某函数专属保留的并发配额，同时也是该函数的并发上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预置并发</td>\n<td>提前初始化的函数实例，完全消除冷启动延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动</td>\n<td>新实例从零初始化到就绪状态所需的时间（100ms~10s）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scale-to-Zero</td>\n<td>无请求时将副本数缩减到 0，完全零成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KPA</td>\n<td>Knative Pod Autoscaler，基于并发数伸缩，支持 Scale-to-Zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定窗口</td>\n<td>决策伸缩时使用的时间窗口，用于抑制短暂波动引起的频繁伸缩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"serverless-弹性的工作原理\">Serverless 弹性的工作原理</h2><p>与传统自动伸缩不同，Serverless 的伸缩单元是<strong>函数实例</strong>（AWS Lambda）或<strong>容器副本</strong>（Knative/Cloud Run），平台负责全部伸缩逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{是否有\\n空闲实例?}&#10;    B -- 有 --&gt; C[复用实例处理\\n温启动 &lt; 5ms]&#10;    B -- 没有 --&gt; D{是否超过\\n并发上限?}&#10;    D -- 没超过 --&gt; E[启动新实例\\n冷启动 100ms~10s]&#10;    D -- 超过了 --&gt; F[请求被限流\\n429 Too Many Requests]&#10;    E --&gt; G[处理请求]&#10;    C --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H{实例空闲超过\\n超时时间?}&#10;    H -- 是 --&gt; I[回收实例]&#10;    H -- 否 --&gt; J[保留实例\\n等待下次请求]\">flowchart TD\n    A[请求到达] --&gt; B{是否有\\n空闲实例?}\n    B -- 有 --&gt; C[复用实例处理\\n温启动 &lt; 5ms]\n    B -- 没有 --&gt; D{是否超过\\n并发上限?}\n    D -- 没超过 --&gt; E[启动新实例\\n冷启动 100ms~10s]\n    D -- 超过了 --&gt; F[请求被限流\\n429 Too Many Requests]\n    E --&gt; G[处理请求]\n    C --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H{实例空闲超过\\n超时时间?}\n    H -- 是 --&gt; I[回收实例]\n    H -- 否 --&gt; J[保留实例\\n等待下次请求]</pre><h2 id=\"aws-lambda-并发模型\">AWS Lambda 并发模型</h2><h3 id=\"并发限制的层次\">并发限制的层次</h3><p>Lambda 的并发（Concurrency）是指<strong>同时处理的请求数</strong>，不是实例数。每个正在执行的调用占用一个并发单元。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"账户级限制（默认 1000，可申请增加到 100,000+）&#10;    ├── 函数保留并发（Reserved Concurrency）&#10;    │   └── 为某个函数专门保留的并发配额，其他函数无法占用&#10;    │       同时也是该函数的最大并发上限&#10;    └── 未保留并发（Unreserved Concurrency）&#10;        └── 账户级限制 - 所有函数的保留并发 = 共享池\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>账户级限制（默认 1000，可申请增加到 100,000+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── 函数保留并发（Reserved Concurrency）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── 为某个函数专门保留的并发配额，其他函数无法占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │       同时也是该函数的最大并发上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── 未保留并发（Unreserved Concurrency）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        └── 账户级限制 - 所有函数的保留并发 = 共享池</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>配置保留并发</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import boto3&#10;&#10;client = boto3.client(&#39;lambda&#39;)&#10;&#10;# 为关键函数保留 500 并发（保证它不被其他函数挤占）&#10;client.put_function_concurrency(&#10;    FunctionName=&#39;order-processor&#39;,&#10;    ReservedConcurrentExecutions=500&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 为批处理函数设置上限（防止它消耗太多配额影响在线服务）&#10;client.put_function_concurrency(&#10;    FunctionName=&#39;batch-data-export&#39;,&#10;    ReservedConcurrentExecutions=50&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3.client(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambda'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为关键函数保留 500 并发（保证它不被其他函数挤占）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client.put_function_concurrency(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    FunctionName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-processor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ReservedConcurrentExecutions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为批处理函数设置上限（防止它消耗太多配额影响在线服务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client.put_function_concurrency(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    FunctionName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'batch-data-export'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ReservedConcurrentExecutions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"预置并发-provisioned-concurrency-消灭冷启动\">预置并发（Provisioned Concurrency）：消灭冷启动</h3><p><strong>预置并发</strong>提前初始化指定数量的函数实例，让它们处于就绪状态，完全消除这部分请求的冷启动延迟：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 为生产别名配置预置并发&#10;client.put_provisioned_concurrency_config(&#10;    FunctionName=&#39;order-api&#39;,&#10;    Qualifier=&#39;production&#39;,   # Lambda 别名或版本&#10;    ProvisionedConcurrentExecutions=100  # 预置 100 个实例&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 配置预置并发的自动伸缩（Application Auto Scaling）&#10;aas_client = boto3.client(&#39;application-autoscaling&#39;)&#10;&#10;# 注册可伸缩目标&#10;aas_client.register_scalable_target(&#10;    ServiceNamespace=&#39;lambda&#39;,&#10;    ResourceId=&#39;function:order-api:production&#39;,&#10;    ScalableDimension=&#39;lambda:function:ProvisionedConcurrency&#39;,&#10;    MinCapacity=10,&#10;    MaxCapacity=500&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 目标追踪策略：维持利用率在 70%&#10;aas_client.put_scaling_policy(&#10;    PolicyName=&#39;provisioned-concurrency-scaling&#39;,&#10;    ServiceNamespace=&#39;lambda&#39;,&#10;    ResourceId=&#39;function:order-api:production&#39;,&#10;    ScalableDimension=&#39;lambda:function:ProvisionedConcurrency&#39;,&#10;    PolicyType=&#39;TargetTrackingScaling&#39;,&#10;    TargetTrackingScalingPolicyConfiguration={&#10;        &#39;TargetValue&#39;: 0.7,  # 70% 利用率触发扩展预置并发&#10;        &#39;PredefinedMetricSpecification&#39;: {&#10;            &#39;PredefinedMetricType&#39;: &#39;LambdaProvisionedConcurrencyUtilization&#39;&#10;        },&#10;        &#39;ScaleInCooldown&#39;: 300,&#10;        &#39;ScaleOutCooldown&#39;: 60&#10;    }&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 为生产别名配置预置并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">client.put_provisioned_concurrency_config(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    FunctionName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-api'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    Qualifier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Lambda 别名或版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ProvisionedConcurrentExecutions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 预置 100 个实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 配置预置并发的自动伸缩（Application Auto Scaling）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">aas_client </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3.client(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application-autoscaling'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 注册可伸缩目标</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">aas_client.register_scalable_target(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ServiceNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambda'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ResourceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function:order-api:production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ScalableDimension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambda:function:ProvisionedConcurrency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    MinCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    MaxCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 目标追踪策略：维持利用率在 70%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">aas_client.put_scaling_policy(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    PolicyName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'provisioned-concurrency-scaling'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ServiceNamespace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambda'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ResourceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'function:order-api:production'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ScalableDimension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'lambda:function:ProvisionedConcurrency'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    PolicyType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'TargetTrackingScaling'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TargetTrackingScalingPolicyConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'TargetValue'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 70% 利用率触发扩展预置并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'PredefinedMetricSpecification'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            'PredefinedMetricType'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LambdaProvisionedConcurrencyUtilization'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'ScaleInCooldown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        'ScaleOutCooldown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"lambda-冷启动优化策略\">Lambda 冷启动优化策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>实现成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预置并发</td>\n<td>完全消除冷启动</td>\n<td>高（按预置时间收费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减小部署包大小</td>\n<td>降低 50%~80% 初始化时间</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用 SnapStart（Java）</td>\n<td>冷启动从 10s 降到 &lt; 1s</td>\n<td>低（配置项）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>将重依赖移到全局作用域</td>\n<td>连接复用，降低 70% 后续冷启动</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>选择轻量运行时（Node.js/Python vs Java）</td>\n<td>冷启动从 3~10s 降到 100ms</td>\n<td>高（需要语言迁移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时 ping（Warm-up）</td>\n<td>绕过冷启动（不治本）</td>\n<td>低（但增加费用）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>全局作用域复用连接（Python 示例）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import boto3&#10;import psycopg2&#10;&#10;# 全局作用域：Lambda 实例复用时不会重复执行&#10;dynamodb = boto3.resource(&#39;dynamodb&#39;)&#10;table = dynamodb.Table(&#39;orders&#39;)&#10;&#10;# 数据库连接放全局，复用而不是每次请求新建&#10;db_conn = None&#10;&#10;def get_db_conn():&#10;    global db_conn&#10;    if db_conn is None or db_conn.closed:&#10;        db_conn = psycopg2.connect(&#10;            host=os.environ[&#39;DB_HOST&#39;],&#10;            database=&#39;mydb&#39;,&#10;            user=os.environ[&#39;DB_USER&#39;],&#10;            password=os.environ[&#39;DB_PASS&#39;]&#10;        )&#10;    return db_conn&#10;&#10;def handler(event, context):&#10;    conn = get_db_conn()  # 复用连接&#10;    # 处理请求...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psycopg2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 全局作用域：Lambda 实例复用时不会重复执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dynamodb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> boto3.resource(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dynamodb'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">table </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dynamodb.Table(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数据库连接放全局，复用而不是每次请求新建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">db_conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> get_db_conn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_conn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_conn.closed:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        db_conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> psycopg2.connect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">os.environ[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DB_HOST'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            database</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mydb'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            user</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">os.environ[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DB_USER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            password</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">os.environ[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DB_PASS'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db_conn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> handler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event, context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> get_db_conn()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 复用连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 处理请求...</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"knative-serving-kubernetes-上的-serverless\">Knative Serving：Kubernetes 上的 Serverless</h2><p><strong>Knative Serving</strong> 为 Kubernetes 带来了 Serverless 弹性能力，支持从 0 扩展到 N，以及 Scale-to-Zero（无请求时缩到 0 个 Pod）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"knative-service-配置\">Knative Service 配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: serving.knative.dev/v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: my-api&#10;  namespace: default&#10;spec:&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      annotations:&#10;        # 并发控制&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/target: &#39;100&#39; # 每 Pod 目标并发数&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/targetUtilizationPercentage: &#39;70&#39;&#10;&#10;        # 伸缩范围&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale: &#39;0&#39; # 最小 0（Scale-to-Zero）&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/maxScale: &#39;50&#39; # 最大 50&#10;&#10;        # 缩容等待时间（0 副本前等待多久）&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleToZeroGracePeriod: &#39;30s&#39;&#10;&#10;        # 稳定窗口&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/window: &#39;60s&#39; # 稳定窗口（抑制抖动）&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/panicWindowPercentage: &#39;10.0&#39; # 恐慌窗口比例&#10;        autoscaling.knative.dev/panicThresholdPercentage: &#39;200.0&#39; # 恐慌阈值（2倍目标）&#10;    spec:&#10;      containerConcurrency: 100 # 每个容器最大并发数（软限制）&#10;      containers:&#10;        - image: gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest&#10;          resources:&#10;            requests:&#10;              cpu: 200m&#10;              memory: 256Mi&#10;            limits:&#10;              cpu: 1000m&#10;              memory: 512Mi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">serving.knative.dev/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 并发控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每 Pod 目标并发数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/targetUtilizationPercentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'70'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 伸缩范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最小 0（Scale-to-Zero）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/maxScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最大 50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 缩容等待时间（0 副本前等待多久）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleToZeroGracePeriod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 稳定窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60s'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 稳定窗口（抑制抖动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/panicWindowPercentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10.0'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 恐慌窗口比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        autoscaling.knative.dev/panicThresholdPercentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'200.0'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 恐慌阈值（2倍目标）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containerConcurrency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 每个容器最大并发数（软限制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">200m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">256Mi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1000m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">512Mi</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"knative-的两种伸缩算法\">Knative 的两种伸缩算法</h3><p><strong>KPA（Knative Pod Autoscaler，默认）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于并发数伸缩</li>\n<li>支持 Scale-to-Zero</li>\n<li>响应极快（秒级）</li>\n<li>使用稳定窗口和恐慌窗口双模式</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>HPA（Horizontal Pod Autoscaler）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 CPU/内存</li>\n<li>不支持 Scale-to-Zero</li>\n<li>Knative 可配置使用 HPA 替代 KPA</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 切换到 HPA 模式&#10;metadata:&#10;  annotations:&#10;    autoscaling.knative.dev/class: hpa.autoscaling.knative.dev&#10;    autoscaling.knative.dev/metric: cpu&#10;    autoscaling.knative.dev/target: &#39;70&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 切换到 HPA 模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    autoscaling.knative.dev/class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hpa.autoscaling.knative.dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    autoscaling.knative.dev/metric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">cpu</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    autoscaling.knative.dev/target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'70'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"scale-to-zero-的权衡\">Scale-to-Zero 的权衡</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方面</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>零空闲成本</td>\n<td>首次请求有冷启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源效率</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>冷启动期间用户等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>低频/间歇性服务</td>\n<td>不适合对延迟敏感的服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>缓解 Scale-to-Zero 冷启动的方法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 方案一：设置 minScale = 1，牺牲一点成本换冷启动保障&#10;autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale: &#39;1&#39;&#10;&#10;# 方案二：配置缩到零前的延迟时间（请求量低但未完全消失时保留实例）&#10;autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleToZeroGracePeriod: &#39;120s&#39;&#10;&#10;# 方案三：使用 Initial Scale（新版本发布时预热 N 个副本）&#10;autoscaling.knative.dev/initialScale: &#39;5&#39;&#10;autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleDownDelay: &#39;3m&#39; # 新版本上线后 3 分钟内不缩容\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方案一：设置 minScale = 1，牺牲一点成本换冷启动保障</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">autoscaling.knative.dev/minScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方案二：配置缩到零前的延迟时间（请求量低但未完全消失时保留实例）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleToZeroGracePeriod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'120s'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方案三：使用 Initial Scale（新版本发布时预热 N 个副本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">autoscaling.knative.dev/initialScale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">autoscaling.knative.dev/scaleDownDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3m'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 新版本上线后 3 分钟内不缩容</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"cloud-run-gcp-的托管-knative\">Cloud Run：GCP 的托管 Knative</h2><p><strong>Cloud Run</strong> 是 GCP 基于 Knative 构建的全托管 Serverless 容器服务，无需管理 Kubernetes：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 部署 Cloud Run 服务，配置并发和伸缩&#10;gcloud run deploy my-api \\&#10;  --image gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest \\&#10;  --region us-central1 \\&#10;  --concurrency 80 \\           # 每实例最大并发 80&#10;  --min-instances 1 \\          # 最小 1 个实例（避免冷启动）&#10;  --max-instances 100 \\        # 最大 100 个实例&#10;  --cpu 2 \\&#10;  --memory 512Mi \\&#10;  --cpu-throttling               # 仅处理请求时分配 CPU（降低成本）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 部署 Cloud Run 服务，配置并发和伸缩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcloud</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gcr.io/my-project/my-api:latest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --region</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> us-central1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 80</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 每实例最大并发 80</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --min-instances</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 最小 1 个实例（避免冷启动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --max-instances</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 最大 100 个实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --cpu</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --memory</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 512Mi</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --cpu-throttling</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 仅处理请求时分配 CPU（降低成本）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Cloud Run 的特殊功能</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# CPU 始终分配模式（适合需要后台处理的服务）&#10;gcloud run deploy my-api \\&#10;  --no-cpu-throttling&#10;&#10;# 配置请求超时（防止长请求占用并发槽位）&#10;gcloud run deploy my-api \\&#10;  --timeout 60s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CPU 始终分配模式（适合需要后台处理的服务）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcloud</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --no-cpu-throttling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 配置请求超时（防止长请求占用并发槽位）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gcloud</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 60s</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"serverless-弹性的限制与监控\">Serverless 弹性的限制与监控</h2><h3 id=\"并发限制对系统的影响\">并发限制对系统的影响</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[突发流量:1000 req/s] --&gt; B{Lambda 并发\\n是否足够?}&#10;    B -- 不足(限流) --&gt; C[429 错误\\n客户端需要重试]&#10;    B -- 足够 --&gt; D[是否触发\\n大量冷启动?]&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[请求 P99 延迟激增\\n100ms → 2000ms]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F[正常处理]\">flowchart TD\n    A[突发流量:1000 req/s] --&gt; B{Lambda 并发\\n是否足够?}\n    B -- 不足(限流) --&gt; C[429 错误\\n客户端需要重试]\n    B -- 足够 --&gt; D[是否触发\\n大量冷启动?]\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[请求 P99 延迟激增\\n100ms → 2000ms]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F[正常处理]</pre><h3 id=\"关键监控指标\">关键监控指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并发执行数（Concurrent Executions）</td>\n<td>Lambda</td>\n<td>&gt; 保留并发的 85%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷启动率（Init Duration 比例）</td>\n<td>Lambda</td>\n<td>&gt; 5% 的请求有冷启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流错误（Throttles）</td>\n<td>Lambda</td>\n<td>&gt; 0（有任何限流立即告警）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例数（Instance Count）</td>\n<td>Cloud Run/Knative</td>\n<td>接近 maxInstances</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>请求延迟 P99</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>&gt; SLA 目标 × 1.5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Knative 查看当前伸缩状态&#10;kubectl get pods -n default -l serving.knative.dev/service=my-api&#10;kubectl get ksvc my-api -o yaml | grep -A 10 status&#10;&#10;# 查看 KPA 当前决策&#10;kubectl describe pa my-api-00001\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Knative 查看当前伸缩状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> serving.knative.dev/service=my-api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ksvc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-api</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -A</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 KPA 当前决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-api-00001</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"选择合适的-serverless-弹性平台\">选择合适的 Serverless 弹性平台</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐平台</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AWS 环境，轻量级函数</td>\n<td>Lambda + 预置并发</td>\n<td>生态完整，运维最简</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GCP 环境，容器化服务</td>\n<td>Cloud Run</td>\n<td>全托管，冷启动快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有 K8s 集群，需要 Scale-to-Zero</td>\n<td>Knative Serving</td>\n<td>开源，可控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高吞吐，延迟敏感（P99&lt;50ms）</td>\n<td>不推荐 Serverless</td>\n<td>传统 HPA 更稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间歇性批处理任务</td>\n<td>Lambda（Event-driven）</td>\n<td>按调用付费，空闲零成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>Serverless 弹性的核心价值在于<strong>把运维成本转化为按需付费</strong>——零流量时零成本，峰值时秒级扩展到任意规模，平台接管所有容量管理。代价是并发限制和冷启动延迟：对于延迟敏感的服务（P99 &lt; 100ms），通过预置并发消除冷启动，但会引入固定费用；对于低频/间歇性服务，Scale-to-Zero 是最优选择，允许接受首次请求的冷启动延迟。Knative 和 Cloud Run 将这套模式带到了容器化服务，让非函数形式的工作负载也能享受 Serverless 弹性——选型时根据工作负载的延迟要求和调用频率在 Lambda、Cloud Run 和传统 HPA 之间权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>上一篇：<a href=\"cloud-provider-autoscaling\">云厂商弹性服务</a>——虚机级弹性与 Serverless 弹性的对比</li>\n<li>下一章：<a href=\"../operations/load-testing-capacity\">负载测试与容量验证</a>——Serverless 和传统服务共用的容量验证方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Serverless 弹性：Lambda 并发、Knative 与并发限制","id":"serverless-弹性-lambda-并发-knative-与并发限制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Serverless 弹性的工作原理","id":"serverless-弹性的工作原理"},{"level":2,"text":"AWS Lambda 并发模型","id":"aws-lambda-并发模型"},{"level":3,"text":"并发限制的层次","id":"并发限制的层次"},{"level":3,"text":"预置并发（Provisioned Concurrency）：消灭冷启动","id":"预置并发-provisioned-concurrency-消灭冷启动"},{"level":3,"text":"Lambda 冷启动优化策略","id":"lambda-冷启动优化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Knative Serving：Kubernetes 上的 Serverless","id":"knative-serving-kubernetes-上的-serverless"},{"level":3,"text":"Knative Service 配置","id":"knative-service-配置"},{"level":3,"text":"Knative 的两种伸缩算法","id":"knative-的两种伸缩算法"},{"level":3,"text":"Scale-to-Zero 的权衡","id":"scale-to-zero-的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Cloud Run：GCP 的托管 Knative","id":"cloud-run-gcp-的托管-knative"},{"level":2,"text":"Serverless 弹性的限制与监控","id":"serverless-弹性的限制与监控"},{"level":3,"text":"并发限制对系统的影响","id":"并发限制对系统的影响"},{"level":3,"text":"关键监控指标","id":"关键监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"选择合适的 Serverless 弹性平台","id":"选择合适的-serverless-弹性平台"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"云厂商弹性服务：AWS ASG、GCP MIG 与 Azure VMSS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/platforms/cloud-provider-autoscaling"},"next":{"title":"负载测试与容量验证：找极限、设 Headroom","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/capacity-planning-autoscaling/operations/load-testing-capacity"}}